{"schema_version":"appworld-codex-plan-v1","status":"needs_more_public_schema","failure_reason":"The available public Spotify APIs can identify and follow every EDM artist with at least 23 followers, but they cannot verify the requested postcondition after mutation: no public read API or response field reports whether an artist is currently followed. Re-running search_artists only confirms artist attributes, not follow state.","missing_public_schema_fields":["A public Spotify read endpoint or response field that exposes whether each artist is followed by the authenticated user"],"task_id":"07b42fd_2","task_family":"07b42fd","completion_mode":"status_only","plan_summary":"No compliant executable plan can be produced until followed-artist state is publicly readable for post-mutation verification.","steps":[]}